# Git
.git
.gitignore

# 凭据：.env 里是数据库口令。即使 Dockerfile 不 COPY 它，构建上下文也会被
# 整包发给 docker daemon，且一旦有人加了 COPY . . 就会直接进镜像层。
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# IDE
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# Build artifacts
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test files
*_test.go
*.test

# Documentation
README.md
ROADMAP.md
docs/

# Temporary files
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Large data files that shouldn't be in build context
data/
*.sql
*.dump
*.backup
